### Partners Endpoints
# These endpoints require authentication. Run authentication.http first to get a token.

@access_token = your-token-here

### List Partners
# Get a list of all partners
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### Create Partner
# @name createPartner
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

###
# Capture the created partner ID
@lastCreatedPartnerId = {{createPartner.response.body.id}}

###

### Remove Partner
# Delete a specific partner (uses the ID captured from Create Partner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/partners/{{lastCreatedPartnerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
